<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlītrae</span></b> ,
			ārum, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of the Volsci</i>, <i>in Latium</i>, <i>whence came the
				Octavian family</i>, now <i>Velletri</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
			31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 34</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">6, 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">94</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8,
			379</span></i>.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlīternus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Velitrœ</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
					31</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">30, 38</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 1, 5, § 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">populus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 8,
					12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coloni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					36</span></i>
			.— <i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlīterni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Velitrœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				9, § 64</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 8, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 94</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlīternī-nus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of
				Velitrœ</i>, <i>Veliternian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 6, 8, § 65</span></i>
			. 
			</div>
